/**
 * Ollama Provider - 100% FREE on your device!
 * 
 * No internet needed after installation
 * unlimited usage
 * Your data stays local
 * 
 * INSTALL:
 * curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install | sh
 * 
 * RUN MODELS:
 * ollama run qwen2.5
 * ollama run llama3
 * ollama run mistral
 * ollama run phi
